SUMMARY:Write For Rights: International Affairs Symposium
DESCRIPTION:This is an opportunity for Lewis &amp\; Clark students to get
  involved in the fight against democratic backsliding\, focusing on right
 s violations. Letters of appeal and support will be written on a local\, 
 national\, and international level\, and students will also learn how to 
 comment on proposals being considered by public agencies. They will be ta
 rgeted towards representatives and organizations with the power to suppor
 t people facing injustice. Snacks will be provided\, hope to see you ther
 e!
