X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<section class="lw_accordion_block is-active">\n  <di
 v class="lw_accordion_block_content" aria-hidden="false">\n    <p>\n     
  This is an opportunity for Lewis &amp\; Clark students to get involved i
 n the fight against democratic backsliding\, focusing on rights violation
 s. Letters of appeal and support will be written on a local\, national\, 
 and international level\, and students will also learn how to comment on 
 proposals being considered by public agencies. They will be targeted towa
 rds representatives and organizations with the power to support people fa
 cing injustice. Snacks will be provided\, hope to see you there\n    </p>
 \n  </div>\n</section>
