 ight="225" loading="lazy" data-alt="" data-caption="Abby Martin" data-opt
 imized="true" /></picture></p><p>  Abby Martin is an American journalist\
 , television presenter\, and activist who founded the citizen journalism 
 platform Media Roots and serves on the board of directors for the Media F
 reedom Foundation\, which manages Project Censored. She hosted <i>Breakin
 g the Set</i> on RT America\, gaining international attention when she pu
 blicly condemned the Russian annexation of Crimea live on air\, before la
 unching <i>The Empire Files</i> \, an investigative documentary and inter
 view series. In 2019 she released the feature documentary <i>The Empire F
 iles: Gaza Fights for Freedom</i> . A strong voice on U.S. foreign policy
 \, militarism\, and corporate power\, Martin brings her lens to her prese
 ntation\, <i>Earth's </i><i>Greatest Enemy</i>.</p><p><picture class="lw_
 image lw_image112632  lw_align_left"><source media="(max-width: 500px)" t
