X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  In this online session\, Kim will talk about h
 ow a writing practice can transform a journey\, and share poems written o
 n the road in Ireland Scotland\, Iceland\, and beyond.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <em>
 <span data-originalfontsize="14pt" data-originalcomputedfontsize="18.6666
 66">Join Kim Stafford—poet\, retired professor at Lewis &amp\; Clark Co
 llege\, former Oregon Poet Laureate—to make travel more than seeing the
  sights. He will share how keeping a journal opens doors to deeper\, more
  meaningful connections to the places you</span></em>\n</p>\n<p>\n  &#160
 \;\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span data-originalfontsize="14pt" data-originalcomputed
 fontsize="18.666666"><picture class="lw_image lw_image112232  lw_align_ce
 nter">\n	<source type="image/webp" srcset="https://www.lclark.edu/live/im
 age/gid/675/width/392/height/294/112232_IMG_0143.webp 1x" data-origin="re
 sponsive"/>\n	<source type="image/jpeg" srcset="https://www.lclark.edu/li
 ve/image/gid/675/width/392/height/294/112232_IMG_0143.rev.1772215739.jpg 
 1x" data-origin="responsive"/>\n	<img alt="" width="392" height="294" dat
