 d/675/width/392/height/294/112232_IMG_0143.rev.1772215739.jpg" title="IMG
  0143" data-max-w="600" data-max-h="450" loading="lazy" data-optimized="t
 rue"/>\n</picture><em>Kim will also share a glimpse of his upcoming guide
 d trip to Ireland in September 2026\, where he'll lead travelers to Dubli
 n\, west to Galway\, and north to Belfast\, blending poetry\, history\, w
 ith the quest for peace and discovery. Learn more about the Lewis &amp\; 
 Clark Travel Program <a href="https://college.lclark.edu/offices/alumni/t
 ravel/" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://colleg
