X-LIVEWHALE-ID:388756
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/Los_Angeles
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>Concerned that "separation of church and state" is
  under attack? Join Drs. David Schraub and Patrick Garry (Univ. of South 
 Dakota) to discuss the history— and viability— of this principle in A
 merican jurisprudence\, including how today's Supreme Court will preserve
  it (or not!) after Kennedy v. Bremerton School District (2022). Bring yo
 ur questions and your empty stomachs— RSVP <a href="https://forms.gle/N
 14b4kKpJPgbo6od7">here</a>!</p>
END:VEVENT
