  2026 from 5:00–6:30 p.m. in East Stamm. Please join us for community a
 nd food! While all identities are welcome and encouraged to participate\,
  the focus of social will focus on supporting Asian\, Asian American\, an
 d Pacific Islander identifying communities.RSVP here (https://docs.google
 .com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd3yZmUNXn04tqAtC3VEq3yaUwPAk1ViXPHO3j_G2UpXvASLA/v
 iewform)  If you have questions\, please direct them to Dr. Amy Wang\, am
 ycwang@lclark.edu (mailto:amycwang@lclark.edu).&#160\;
