 PI) <a href="https://www.lclark.edu/about/equity-and-inclusion/employee-r
 esource-groups/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Employee Resource Group</
 a> will be having its first kick off social on Thursday April 9\, 2026 fr
 om 5:00–6:30 p.m. in East Stamm. Please join us for community and food!
  While all identities are welcome and encouraged to participate\, the foc
 us of social will focus on supporting Asian\, Asian American\, and Pacifi
 c Islander identifying communities.</p><p style="text-align: center\;"><a
  class="btn-small-style-1" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQ
 LSd3yZmUNXn04tqAtC3VEq3yaUwPAk1ViXPHO3j_G2UpXvASLA/viewform">RSVP here</a
 ></p><p>  If you have questions\, please direct them to Dr. Amy Wang\, <a
  href="mailto:amycwang@lclark.edu">amycwang@lclark.edu</a>.&#160\;</p>
