 ontrasting musical voices and eras\, featuring works by Bach\, York Bowen
 \, Bohuslav Martinů\, and Dmitri Shostakovich. Through these works\, thi
 s recital explores themes of introspection\, resilience\, and expressive 
 storytelling across musical traditions. Spanning from the intimate clarit
 y of the Baroque to the expressive intensity of the 20th century\, the pr
 ogram highlights the viola's unique ability to bridge lyricism and depth.
  <a href="https://vimeo.com/event/4079258" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 >This performance will be live streamed here.</a></p><p><strong>Parking a
