SUMMARY:ONE L&C Talent / No Talent Cabaret Disco Party
DESCRIPTION:The 21+ event includes complimentary food and a hosted Bar (b
 eer and wine) with donations benefiting GSEC's TransActive (https://gradu
 ate.lclark.edu/programs/continuing_education/transactive/)\, supporting s
 ocial justice and equality for LGBTQAI+ youth and families.  Talent/No Ta
 lent Performances include employees from Lewis &amp\; Clark's Alumni and 
 Parent Programs\, Human Resources\, Executive Council\, Reggie "Regina" R
 aiford\, a law school student band—and a special guest appearance by Mi
 ss Trans Oregon 2024!L&amp\;C Community Casting Call: (https://www.lclark
 .edu/live/news/57772-one-lampc-talent-no-talent-cabaret-disco-party) We d
 isco dare you to grab your bell bottoms and show off your (hidden or hila
 rious) talent to help us raise money for TransActive! If you've got the s
 pirit\, we've got the stage. Interested performers\, please contact Reggi
 e Raiford (mailto:raiford@lclark.edu) by Wednesday\, April 1.  Event Deta
 ils + RSVPDate: Saturday\, April 11Time: Doors open at 6 p.m.\, show star
 ts at 7 p.m.Location: Legal Research Center (free parking)  Please RSVP t
 o let us know how many are planning to attend so that we can plan for foo
 d and drinks accordingly–partners\, spouses\, and friends are welcome!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The 21+ event includes complimentary fo
 od and a hosted Bar (beer and wine) with donations benefiting GSEC's <a h
 ref="https://graduate.lclark.edu/programs/continuing_education/transactiv
 e/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TransActive</a>\, supporting social ju
 stice and equality for LGBTQAI+ youth and families.</p><p>  Talent/No Tal
 ent Performances include employees from Lewis &amp\; Clark's Alumni and P
 arent Programs\, Human Resources\, Executive Council\, Reggie "Regina" Ra
 iford\, a law school student band—and a special guest appearance by Mis
 s Trans Oregon 2024!</p><p><a href="https://www.lclark.edu/live/news/5777
 2-one-lampc-talent-no-talent-cabaret-disco-party" target="_blank" rel="no
 opener">L&amp\;C Community Casting Call:</a> We disco dare you to grab yo
 ur bell bottoms and show off your (hidden or hilarious) talent to help us
  raise money for TransActive! If you've got the spirit\, we've got the st
 age. Interested performers\, please contact <a href="mailto:raiford@lclar
 k.edu">Reggie Raiford</a> by Wednesday\, April 1.</p><h2>  Event Details 
 + RSVP</h2><p><strong>Date:</strong> Saturday\, April 11</p><p><strong>Ti
 me:</strong> Doors open at 6 p.m.\, show starts at 7 p.m.</p><p><strong>L
 ocation:</strong> Legal Research Center (free parking)</p><p>  Please <st
 rong>RSVP</strong> to let us know how many are planning to attend so that
  we can plan for food and drinks accordingly–partners\, spouses\, and f
 riends are welcome!</p>
