SUMMARY:Savage Dissertation Defense
DESCRIPTION:Lara Savage\, a candidate in the Doctor of Education in Leade
 rship Program\, will defend her dissertation at 10:30 AM PT on Monday\, A
 pril 13\, 2026 in York 116.  Her dissertation is titled "Compliance Over 
 Care: A Critical Autoethnography of Parent Advocacy and School Interpreta
 tion of Student Anxiety" and the chair of her committee is Dr. Elizabeth 
 Denevi.  This event is open to the public.  The presentation may be viewe
 d via Zoom (https://lclark-edu.zoom.us/j/99514482794?pwd=zqsk4e5SgDas0oup
 3B1MB4jy39ateQ.1).
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Lara Savage\, a candidate in the Doctor
  of Education in Leadership Program\, will defend her dissertation at 10:
 30 AM PT on Monday\, April 13\, 2026 in York 116.</p><p>  Her dissertatio
 n is titled "Compliance Over Care: A Critical Autoethnography of Parent A
 dvocacy and School Interpretation of Student Anxiety" and the chair of he
 r committee is Dr. Elizabeth Denevi.</p><p>  This event is open to the pu
 blic.</p><p>  The presentation may be viewed <a href="https://lclark-edu.
 zoom.us/j/99514482794?pwd=zqsk4e5SgDas0oup3B1MB4jy39ateQ.1" target="_blan
 k" rel="noopener">via Zoom</a>.</p>
