SUMMARY:2026 L&C Athletics Virtual Series: Thursdays at Noon
DESCRIPTION:From season previews and recruiting updates to stories of int
 ernational competition and professional careers in the NBA and beyond\, t
 hese sessions celebrate the journey of the student-athlete and the enduri
 ng strength of the L&amp\;C network. Whether you are a fan\, a former ath
 lete\, or a supporter of the program\, tune in to hear how we are buildin
 g a championship culture on the field\, in the classroom\, and throughout
  our community.This series has two day/time slots: the third Wednesday of
  every month at 5:00 PM Pacific Time and Thursdays at 12:00 Pacific Time 
 - January 22nd and then the third Thursdays thereafter.  This series take
 s place Thursday\, January 22 and thereafter the third Thursday of every 
 month at 12:00 PM Pacific Time.&#160\;Click to Register for one or more o
 f the Thursday sessions (https://engage.lclark.edu/register/?id=3f52191c-
 dccb-40e3-ab98-a0794a499ce5)Session Dates and Topics:January 22\, 12:00-1
 :00 PM PT: The Unified Front: From Local Leadership to the World Stage  F
 ebruary 19\, 12:00-1:00 PM PT: Chasing Greatness: Recruitment\, Research\
 , and the Road to Pro  March 19\, 12:00-1:00 PM PT: The Big League Path: 
 From Campus Internships to the NBA Front Office  April 16\, 12:00-1:00PM 
 PT: Stepping Up to the Plate: Leadership Lessons from L&amp\;C Athletics 
  May 21\, 12:00-1:00 PM PT: Leading from the Circle: Empowerment and Exce
 llence in Sport  Additionally\, visit this link (https://engage.lclark.ed
 u/register/?id=fa8548f3-e4ce-433f-b0f9-b53e925dea22) to learn more and re
 gister for sessions taking place the third Wednesday of each month at 5:0
 0 PM PT
