 ffordarchives.org/">William Stafford Archives</a>\, held at Lewis &amp\; 
 Clark. Featuring linocut art by artist Kristin Vantrease\, this chapbook 
 was lovingly designed and hand sewn by Sam Jordan '97. All profit from sa
