DESCRIPTION:A Discussion with LC Alumnus Snohomish County Executive Dave 
 Somers\, how Local Government works\, its role in current life\, and how 
 to get involved\, either as a citizen or as a career. David J. Somers is 
 an American politician and fisheries biologist serving as the Snohomish C
 ounty Executive\, an office he has held since 2016. Somers previously ser
 ved on the Snohomish County Council\, representing the 5th district in th
 e eastern portion of the county\, and currently serves as Chair of Sound 
 Transit\, the region's light rail and transit agency.Saturday\, April 18\
 , 2026Starting at 2 pm&#160\;Locations: Total Wine &amp\; More (525 NE No
 rthgate Way #5\, Seattle\, WA 98125)  If you have questions\, or&#160\;ar
 e interested in events in the Puget Sound area but are unable to attend t
 his month\, please contact Merrilee MacLean at merrileemaclean@gmail.com 
 (mailto:merrileemaclean@gmail.com)&#160\;  To get the latest information 
 and see pictures from past events\, feel free to check out theLewis &amp\
 ; Clark Alumni of Puget Sound (https://www.facebook.com/groups/lewisandcl
 arkalumnipugetsound/about)
