DESCRIPTION:You are cordially invited to a Lewis &amp\; Clark Alumni happ
 y hour! This is a fantastic opportunity to reconnect with old friends and
  meet our Law Alumni Board in a relaxed setting.  A special thanks to our
  Alumni Board President\, Brad Krupicka '09\, for hosting this evening of
  community and conversation.Space is limited. Please RSVP HERE&#160\;so w
 e can ensure there's plenty of food and drink for everyone!
