SUMMARY:Ramirez Larson Dissertation Defense
DESCRIPTION:Rebecca Ramirez Larson\, a candidate in the Doctor of Educati
 on in Leadership Program\, will defend her dissertation at 10:00 AM PT on
  Thursday\, April 30\, 2026 online.  Her dissertation is titled "Plática
 s with First Generation Latina Teachers (FGLTs): Navigating Nepantla in O
 regon's Educational Borderlands\," and the chair of her committee is Dr. 
 LIna Darwich.  This event is open to the public.  The presentation may be
  viewed via Zoom (https://lclark-edu.zoom.us/j/99243815782?pwd=9A6wFQbKT5
 bfHPh0Ts5ds6L3W3sLv7.1).
