 scounted &#x2018\;Student Rate&#x2019\; registrations are for current stu
 dents only and <strong>do not</strong> include continuing education credi
 t (CEU/PDUs)</em></p></div></li></ul></div><hr /><h2><strong>About the In
 structor</strong></h2><p style="line-height: 1.5\;"><strong>Julianna Verm
 eys\, LPC</strong> has been practicing integrative somatic psychotherapy 
 since 2006. She is dedicated to offering trauma-informed\, holistic thera
 py that addresses systemic\, environmental and relational impacts through
  one's lifespan. Julianna offers equitable\, existential and somatic orie
 nted supervision clinical supervision as an approved supervisor for the O
 BLPCT. She is inspired by family/relationship dynamics\, attachment\, hum
 an development\, trauma-informed healing and wellness\, and client-center
 ed therapy rooted in compassion and unconditional positive regard. She ha
 s specialized training in trauma-informed counseling\, mindfulness\, and 
 body-based therapies. Julianna is registered with Yoga Alliance as RYT 50
 0-hr and is excited by the collective considerations of how we can embrac
 e ancient practices from other cultures with ethical\, conscious care. Sh
 e teaches graduate classes as an adjunct faculty member at the Lewis &amp
 \; Clark Graduate School in the Counseling Program\, and offers trainings
  for clinicians in trauma informed embodiment practices to inform ethical
  clinical work and integrated somatic psychotherapy.</p><div id="lw_widge
 t_470b39ba" class="lw_widget lw_widget_type_blurbs lw_widget_blurbs lw_wi
 dget_id_3994 lw_widget_opt_in lw_widget_pagination"><ul class="lw_widget_
 results lw_widget_results_blurbs"><li class="lw_item_1"><div class="lw_bl
 urbs_body"><p style="line-height: 1.5\;"><em><strong>New workshops and tr
 ainings are added to our calendar regularly.</strong> For the latest on p
 rofessional development related to your specific interests\, <a href="htt
 ps://lclark.tfaforms.net/4735441">sign up for our mailing list!</a></em><
