X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Each year Lewis &amp\; Clark College recognize
 s the achievements of students receiving departmental honors\, the Senior
  Recognition Award\, and the Rena J. Ratte Memorial Award at the annual H
 onors Convocation ceremony.<br />\n  <br />\n  We invite all family and f
 riends to attend and celebrate the award recipients. Registration for thi
 s event is not required.<br />\n  <br />\n  Congratulations to each of ou
 r honors students!\n</p>
END:VEVENT
