 re invited to join us in a celebration of your accomplishments and gradua
 tion from law school! Please RSVP through <a href="https://engage.lclark.
 edu/register/?id=9d82c773-5fa2-41e8-a68a-4d497b4c0618">this link here</a>
  and be sure to have your guests RSVP as well. We look forward to seeing 
 you and celebrating this milestone together!</p>
END:VEVENT
