 6\, 9 a.m.- 4 p.m.\, Clackamas Education Service District\, 13455 SE 97th
  Avenue\, Clackamas\, OR&#160\;</p><p style="line-height: 1.5\; padding-l
 eft: 40px\;"><strong>Virtual:&#160\;</strong>June 23\, 25\, 2026\, 9:30-1
