 Elizabeth Denevi\, PhD\, and Jasmine Locke</p><p style="line-height: 1.5\
 ;"><strong>Graduate Continuing Education credit:</strong> CEED-866-21\, 2
  semester hours\, $770</p><p style="line-height: 1.5\;"><strong>Limited s
 cholarships available</strong> to educators working in a Multnomah or Cla
 ckamas County School District\, MESD\, or CESD. All course texts and mate
