SUMMARY:LC Alumni of Puget Sound: A visit to the Heritage Flying Museum a
 t Paine Field\, followed by a barbecue overlooking Puget Sound at the hom
 e of Ralph Munson '72 in Mukilteo
DESCRIPTION:A visit to the Heritage Flying Museum at Paine Field\, follow
 ed by a barbecue overlooking Puget Sound at the home of Ralph Munson '72 
 in Mukilteo. The Heritage Flying Museum was created by Paul Allen\, gathe
 ring historic aircraft and military equipment. Admission is free if you s
 ign up online in advance (directions will be provided). Space is limited\
 , so early registration is encouraged!  &#160\;Saturday\, August 29\, 202
 6&#160\;Starts 2 pm&#160\;The Heritage Flying Museum at Paine Field  &#16
 0\;  If you have questions\, or are interested in events in the Puget Sou
 nd area but are unable to attend this month\, please contact Merrilee Mac
 Lean at merrileemaclean@gmail.com (mailto:merrileemaclean@gmail.com)  To 
 get the latest information and see pictures from past events\, feel free 
 to check out theLewis &amp\; Clark Alumni of Puget Sound (https://www.fac
 ebook.com/groups/lewisandclarkalumnipugetsound/about)
